<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 575.63, up 3.57.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 298 to 227.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.08.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 22,093,330 compared with 20,472,940 Monday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
